	<caption>
	<b>Example 17</b>
	</caption>
	<tbody>
		<tr>
			<td class="lt-chem-46550">On a humid day at 43.3&deg;C in Galveston, Texas, the vapor pressure of water is 0.087 atm. What is the water content of the atmosphere, expressed as a mole fraction? Assuming that dry air is 20 mole percent 0 and 80 mole percent N<sub>2</sub> what is the water content in percent by weight?</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td class="lt-chem-46550">
			<p class="lt-chem-46550"><b>Solution</b></p>

			<p class="lt-chem-46550">The answers are 0.087 and 5.62%</p>
			</td>
		</tr>
