<div class="thumbinner" style="width:332px;">
<p class="lt-chem-46550"><img alt="" class="thumbimage" data-file-height="246" data-file-width="330" height="246" width="330" src="/upload.wikimedia.org/wikibooks/en/e/e5/Chemical_Principles_Fig_3.15.png" /></p>

