	<caption>
	<b>Example 19</b>
	</caption>
	<tbody>
		<tr>
			<td class="lt-chem-46550">Calculate the relative effusion rates of the two isotopic forms of uranium hexafluoride, <sup>238</sup>UF<sub>6</sub> and <sup>235</sup>UF<sub>6</sub> . All fluorine is <sup>19</sup>F.</td>
		</tr>
